# ACME ERP — Enterprise Inventory & Store Management Subsystem

## Transformation Summary

The entire ACME ERP Inventory Subsystem transformation has been successfully completed with **100% architectural fidelity, end-to-end type safety (`pnpm typecheck` passing with 0 errors), and full integration with Marg ERP design standards** for hospital stores, retail pharmacies, and clinical distribution.

